    <title>A liquid-crystal analogue of the skyrmion Hall effect</title>
    <link href="https://latifkedi.github.io/ahbar/?item=2026-10-19-36-a-liquid-crystal-analogue-of"/>
    <link rel="related" href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-026-03379-0"/>
