    <updated>2026-10-19T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Nature Physics, Published online: 19 October 2026; doi:10.1038/s41567-026-03379-0 Magnetic skyrmions are known to exhibit a Hall effect in the presence of an electric current. Now it is shown that liquid-crystal solitons also exhibit a Hall-like drift under shear flow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-026-03379-0&quot;&gt;Nature Physics&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;strong&gt;Tags:&lt;/strong&gt; #quantum-physics #optics-photonics&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
